    "lawCode": "Add §227, Eld L",
    "lawSection": "Elder Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8072\n\nSPONSOR: CLEARE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the elder law, in relation to establishing an elder\nfinancial exploitation public awareness campaign\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nEstablishes an elder financial exploitation public awareness campaign.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nRequires SOFA and DFS to establish an elder financial exploitation\npublic awareness campaign.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nSadly, over 300,000 New Yorkers are victims of Elder Abuse each year;\nAnd financial crimes and abuse of our Older New Yorkers continues to\nincrease. A broad and robust public awareness campaign is warranted and\nthis legislation provides a seven layer approach to the problem.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew In 2025.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
